WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:03.566
Unit nine. My First App!

2
00:00:04.539 --> 00:00:08.949
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:08.999 --> 00:00:12.072
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.122 --> 00:00:15.658
Today we learn about My First App. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.478 --> 00:00:20.878
App. Say it with me. App!

6
00:00:24.354 --> 00:00:28.452
Icon. Say it with me. Icon!

7
00:00:31.953 --> 00:00:35.911
Open. Say it with me. Open!

8
00:00:39.366 --> 00:00:43.255
Close. Say it with me. Close!

9
00:00:46.814 --> 00:00:50.830
Game. Say it with me. Game!

10
00:00:54.341 --> 00:00:58.299
Learn. Say it with me. Learn!

11
00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:05.315
Tap. Say it with me. Tap!

12
00:01:08.908 --> 00:01:12.591
Use. Say it with me. Use!

13
00:01:15.999 --> 00:01:25.164
An app is a program I use on a tablet or phone. I tap an icon to open it. I can use an app to learn or play a game.

14
00:01:25.214 --> 00:01:29.101
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:29.943 --> 00:01:35.380
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:36.580
Open!

17
00:01:37.498 --> 00:01:42.890
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:44.090
Tap!

19
00:01:44.848 --> 00:01:51.439
Did you know? The word 'app' is short for 'application', which just means a computer program!

20
00:01:51.489 --> 00:01:53.831
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:54.846 --> 00:02:02.984
Think and answer. What is your favorite app to use?

22
00:02:03.034 --> 00:02:04.228
Great answer!

23
00:02:05.147 --> 00:02:11.102
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:11.152 --> 00:02:14.168
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

